<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian refinery signs $40 mln FRN with CSFB.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian refinery signs $40 mln FRN with CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian refinery Mazheikiu Nafta said on Friday that it has signed an agreement for Credit Suisse First Boston to lead manage a $40 million FRN issue.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said all necessary documents have been signed, and the term of the FRN was for seven months.</p>
<p>Financial analysts, who declined to be identified, said the repayment would take place in two stages, one after three months and one four months later. -- Andrius Vilkancas, Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
